   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 1.4,
   "text": "IT HUNTS BY SOUND.",
   "y": -420,
   "fontSize": 46
  },
  {
   "text": "This horror demo is two\nhundred and sixty-three\nmegabytes, and the monster\nin it hunts by sound.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 5.74,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Every noise you make, it\nhears.",
   "start": 5.99,
   "duration": 2.266,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "MORROWTAPE. You're under a\ncondemned 1989 telephone\narchive with a radio,\ntuning in calls that\nshouldn't exist.",
   "start": 10.506,
   "duration": 7.125,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Find the frequency, take\nthe call, and stay quiet.",
   "start": 17.881,
   "duration": 3.128,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Every other horror demo I\nmeasured this week was\nbigger. This one is small,\nand it's all atmosphere.",
   "start": 21.259,
   "duration": 5.871,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "English only, and out on\nSteam now as a free demo.",
   "start": 27.38,
   "duration": 3.363,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  }
 ],
